{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short psychological horror experience inspired by Guaran\u00ed folklore. After a simple gathering at a friend\u2019s house, you begin to realize that the night hides something watching from the shadows. What starts as an ordinary evening turns into a chilling tale where every choice determines your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on <strong>atmosphere, narrative, and player choice</strong>, rather than complex mechanics or constant action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first-person for full immersion or with fixed cameras for a tense, cinematic experience. Explore the environment, uncover story details, and make choices that lead to multiple outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> ~15 minutes per playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total content:</strong> ~1.5 hours for all endings</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in <strong>first-person</strong> or with <strong>fixed-camera perspectives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric story inspired by Guaran\u00ed mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, narrative-driven horror with high replay value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that amplifies the fear.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Final - The Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797670/db529c676f80adc8a3ab5ec996796a6636208892.jpg"},{"name":"Final - You Took My Liquor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797670/8f21118d1d93624110811ee3883f051317940070.jpg"},{"name":"Final - Speed","path":