_paragraph\" >This game focuses on <strong>atmosphere, narrative, and player choice</strong>, rather than complex mechanics or constant action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first-person for full immersion or with fixed cameras for a tense, cinematic experience. Explore the environment, uncover story details, and make choices that lead to multiple outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> ~15 minutes per playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total content:</strong> ~1.5 hours for all endings</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in <strong>first-person</strong> or with <strong>fixed-camera perspectives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric story inspired by Guaran\u00ed mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, narrative-driven horror with high replay value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that amplifies the fear.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Yaguarete Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797670/9a72e52979b0534e882d098bdfd4b31abff40844/header.jpg?t=1765830624","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797670/156940052/d3bd49423e3364fbac274f078a8dcbfb7ffff8ec/1764880126/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764880853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797670/156940052/d3bd49423e3364fbac274f078a8dcbfb7ffff8ec/1764880126/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764880853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797670/156940052/d3bd49423e336